      "columns": 12
    },
    {
      "name": "table_07.csv",
      "caption": "Table 7: Experimental results (F1 scores) of our models (i.e. the full model with attentive ensemble of all syntactic information), where BERT or ZEN is used as one of the three types of embeddings (the others are Giga and Tencent Embedding) in the embedding layer.",
      "rows": 3,
      "columns": 4
    },
